<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0145_D51R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, wassup!\rIt’s FREEZIN’, ain’t it?\rA youngster like you bein’\ninto the Sinjoh Ruins is\fsomethin’ we don’t see every day.\rTake a look at ’em.\rFrom the pillars at the\nSinjoh Ruins, you can see the\fcultures of Sinnoh and Johto\fblended.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0145_D51R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What was I thinkin’?\rWe ain’t gotta stand out here.\nWhy don’t you come to the cabin\faround the corner and talk more?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0145_D51R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, we got somebody\nat the cabin.\rEvery Hustler should know who she is.\nThe famous Hustler from Sinnoh!\rShe travel around studyin’\nmyths and ancient ruins.\fAin’t that somethin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0145_D51R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0145_D51R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Bring only your ARCEUS.\rOther homies might get blown away by\nthe power hangin’ around\fthe ruins.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0145_D51R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Looks like your ARCEUS is\nvibin’ with the Ruins.\rMaybe it’s just me but I can\nfeel...\fwe surrounded by strong power.\rThe answer is inside the ruins.\rThe place that been waitin’ for\nits rightful owner...\fthe {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0145_D51R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0145_D51R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Sinjoh Ruins</language>
	</row>
</body>
